  "purpose": "PCP long-range set (owner request 2026-10-08): 950 fps slugs and pellets from 100 m to 600 m. First run (absolute 1 cm bound) showed slugs within 0.08 mrad at 600 m and the BC 0.035 pellet diverging only where it falls almost vertically (500-600 m). By the owner's decision the bound is angular, as dialled on the scope: 0.1 mrad (one click of a 0.1 mrad turret); the pellet case stops at 400 m, beyond any real pellet shot.",
